          <article><span>Gepäck-Belastung</span><strong>${i.cargoEncumbrance}</strong><small>${i.nextEncumbranceAt===void 0?"Maximum":`nächste Stufe ab ${Z(i.nextEncumbranceAt)} Stein`}</small></article>
